        <section id="fees" class="pg-sec bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-4">How Walmart Fulfillment Service Fees Work</h2><p class="pgx-96">WFS charges per unit based on item size, weight, and category. Fees range from $1.50 for small standard items to $8+ for oversize. This calculator breaks down exactly what you&#x27;ll pay.</p></div>
        <!-- <div class="pgx-182"><div class="pgx-94">WFS fee breakdown infographic</div></div> -->
        <div class="pgx-183"><p>Walmart&#x27;s WFS fee structure includes several components: base fulfillment fees covering picking, packing, and shipping, plus handling fees that vary by category, weight surcharges for heavier items, and category-specific markups for certain product types. Oversize items have higher fees.</p><p>The calculator estimates these fees automatically based on the product details you enter: weight, dimensions, and category. All calculations are estimates since Walmart doesn&#x27;t make exact category fee assignments fully transparent. Knowing approximate fees upfront helps you price correctly and avoid unprofitable products.</p></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-5xl"><div class="pg-sec__head"><h2 class="pg-h2">What You Can Calculate</h2><div class="pgx-95"><p class="pgx-96">Our calculator goes beyond just fees. Calculate profitability, compare to other fulfillment methods, and analyze entire product catalogs at once.</p></div></div><div class="pgx-109"><div class="pg-card"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-calculator" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="14" y2="18"></line><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">Single Item WFS Fee</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Enter SKU, weight, category, price. Get exact WFS fee in seconds.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-widt